### Duplicate expensive work identified

1. **`status_test.go:1216` — `t.Cleanup(func() { reinstall(t) })` inside a four-case loop.**
   All four moves mutate **only** `home/cache/build`: `corruptCacheArtifact` (`status_test.go:270`),
